      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2017 Wiley-VCH Verlag GmbH & Co. KGaA, Weinheim.",
        "AbstractText": "Substituted indoles can be prepared from phenylazocarboxylates through a rapid one-pot sequence featuring a microwave-assisted Fischer indole synthesis as a key step. Considering that the phenylazocarboxylates may beforehand be modified by mild nucleophilic aromatic substitution, including the introduction of [18 F]fluoride, the overall strategy offers an attractive new access to 5-[18 F]fluoroindoles."
      },
